      "diff": "--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/sumbi/handoff.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+<!-- sumbi:begin handoff -->\n+# Handoff convention\n+\n+Keep each live handoff in a local location approved by the repository owner. Do not commit session transcripts, secrets or machine paths.\n+\n+Record the deliverable ID and acceptance criteria, current state, files changed, checks actually run, unresolved risks, and the next action. Separate observations from assumptions. A successor should be able to resume without repeating the investigation.\n+<!-- sumbi:end handoff -->\n"
